  m_Name: QuadsRoller
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope your sleigh is almost ready for Christmas Eve!  I wish to be fast as your
    sleigh with rollers!
  - I hope you are not too busy getting all the presents ready!  I would love a pair
    of rollers so I can glide as fast as your sleigh. It would be amazing! Thanks,
    Santa.
  - "I hope you and your reindeer are doing okay!  I\u2019m wishing for two little
    wheels on each foot to help me fly across the ground."
